@dreamina_ai "Code-rendered" is the part I'd actually use.

A video model makes you re-roll the shot. Motion graphics let you fix the timing, the type, and the entrance without burning another take.

That's how titles and explainers should work.

@lxfater 这种 skill 真正值得看的，可能不是专项有多少，而是第一条：用代码锁死授权边界，不乱扫无关目标。

装之前先确认，默认只能对着自己有授权的站点动手。

